WEBVTT

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:12.200
We will not fight!

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.790
Well, last year, a fight broke out when
we played a match against this team...

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:21.500
The match was almost cancelled...

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.910
Stop it!

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:27.750
I heard that the team this
year was the worst to date.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.160
Huh?! Try saying that to our face after
winning a single game against us!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.660
Hey, Ueoka.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:36.450
I heard you quit rugby for a while.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.660
Why?

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.750
Cause you had an accident with
the bike you got from your daddy?

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.250
That's...

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.580
That's none of your business!

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.700
Don't underestimate Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.120
Stop it!

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.410
Retreat for now!

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:56.830
I'm sorry...

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.160
Natsusa!

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.120
But!

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.870
--Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!
--Natsusa! Where's your apology?!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.200
--I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
--Natsusa! Where's your apology?!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.950
Ikuto-<i>san</i>, I'm sorry!

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.040
Whew, is that all of it? Okay!

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.750
Oh! Excuse me!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.250
"Sasa Institute University"

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:30.120
Are you a first year from Doushisha?

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:33.500
Y-Yes. You are from Sasa
Institute University, right?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.580
Please take care of us today!

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:41.290
You're from Raselle High School
in Kyushu, right? You became a manager?

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.910
Huh? Yes...

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.950
Have we met somewhere before?

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.700
The hell is this?

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.620
It's full of information on us...

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.870
Oh, that's mine!

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:53.700
Hold on!

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:54.120
"Sasa Institute University"

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:58.580
"Sasa Institute University"
Whoa! This is too much! This ain't right!

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:00.700
"Sasa Institute University"
This goes against the private information protection law!

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:06.000
Th-The information I have in each
person's profile is public information.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.450
The rest are results from my own analysis
and does not go against the protection law.

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:12.370
Huh?

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.790
Please give it back.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:16.620
Give it back to him.

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.870
Here.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:18.500
Oops.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:19.700
Huh?

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.250
Sorry 'bout that!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.000
"Meditation is pretty hard."

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.120
Yuu!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.120
Yasunari-<i>kun</i>!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:28.040
Bringing the cooler boxes over
took longer than I thought!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.830
What happened?

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.500
Huh? Nothing...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.870
Liar! What are you hiding? Show me!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.080
I'm not hiding anything!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.290
Show me!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.950
Those bastards!

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.910
Yasunari-<i>kun</i>! Don't!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:45.750
Let go!

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.000
I won't!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:51.790
I can just buy a new tablet!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:57.290
But if the match gets canceled, the work
everyone has put in will go to waste!

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:02.410
And, this is the last season
for the fourth year students.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.250
Please calm down!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.830
Please defeat them in the match!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.370
The match. We'll definitely win it.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.660
Yes!

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:19.120
Stick close to me while we're here.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.370
Okay.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.330
I'll give you a push.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:43.370
Taisei, the other number 5 was here
last year and he's pretty quick.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.870
He's good at tackling, but he's
especially good with the ball--

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.790
You should be starting, Mako-<i>san</i>.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.330
Huh?

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:52.620
You should be in the starting lineup.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.790
Stop that already.
You're causing trouble for Taku, too.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.040
But...!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:03.830
Taisei, if you have time to think about
things like that, focus on the match.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.330
Yes.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.160
Okay.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.830
So, about that number 5...

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.080
Oh! Yuu! There you are!

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:17.370
Natsusa-<i>san</i>, I'm sorry for being late!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.330
No problem. Thanks for
bringing the cooler boxes!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.450
I'm going to tape Sei. Didn't you want to watch?

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.750
I'd love to!

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.080
You all right?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:32.910
Yes...

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.950
Shingyouji, have you quelled
the chaos within your heart?

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:44.750
I see.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:48.200
Then, let us meditate for a moment.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.620
Will you join us, Pong?

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:50.950
Yeah.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:07:01.370
Listen. Focus on your breathing
and be thankful for all things.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.620
As usual, what a bizarre scene...

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:07.870
Wh-What should we do?

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.330
Should we come back later?

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.910
We're a bother, aren't we?

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.950
It's fine. I always do it while he's like this.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:19.830
I think his left and right balance was off
last time, so I'll do his back today, too.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:28.410
Huh? Yuu. You aren't taking any video today?

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:33.410
Oh, I accidentally dropped my
tablet earlier and it's broken now.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:35.830
What?! Isn't that a super shock for you?!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:40.370
I have all the data backed-up
on my computer, so it's fine!

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.250
I see.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.080
More importantly, please show me how you tape.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:48.700
Okay! Then, since you're not recording,
try touching his back.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:55.250
There are muscles here and here on the back.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:08:00.330
Sei has a lot of muscle focused
in this area. Do you feel it?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.540
Yes, I can.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:08.330
Then, starting from this muscle,
I tape in this direction...

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.750
There! I'm done.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.540
It's pretty difficult...

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.700
That's not true.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:19.700
When I was a player, I did all my
taping based on my instincts.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:23.160
I studied in-depth about it after
deciding to become a manager.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:27.450
So, I've only recently been
able to do it properly.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.000
I'm sure you'll be quick to catch on, Yuu.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.620
Yes!

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:34.700
Take a deep breath at the end.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.910
Let us not forget this thankfulness
during our match today as well.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:54.370
It'll probably be a physical battle today.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:58.120
It's fine to fight back against them,
but avoid getting fouls.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:00.370
Don't get caught up in their pace.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:05.950
As you all know, we can't go to
nationals if we don't win this match.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.040
Yes!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.200
Who are we?

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.500
Doushisha!

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.160
"Kansai University Rugby A League
Doushisha University
VS
Sasa Institute University"

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:36.200
Don't get so pissed over such a little thing.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.620
Little thing?

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.700
Thank goodness.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.160
Looks like it didn't break out into a fight.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:53.540
Yasunari-<i>kun </i>already has one yellow card.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.910
It's fine.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:58.410
Even Yasunari isn't <i>that </i>stupid...

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.000
Sasa Institute, Number 10.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.160
Over the top.

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.000
I was still standing!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.370
No, you were definitely over it.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:17.830
Huh? What'd you say?

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.000
The hell?!

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.410
What the hell!

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:24.160
Use your Japanese.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.160
Stop it!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.580
Calm down.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.370
We'd like a place kick.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.120
Place kick.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.870
Looks like they're doing a penalty kick.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.080
That distance should be easy for him.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:41.000
I should go and refill the ice.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.910
Oh! I'll do it!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.660
It's fine. It's fine. Watch the match.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.660
No way.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.290
"Doushisha University"      "Sasa Institute University"
"Score"
"Total Score"

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:30.160
Number 8. Failure to release ball.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:37.370
As expected of Su-<i>san</i>! Such a bad personality!

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.410
Shingyouji. Can you do it?

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:42.200
Yes.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.790
Another penalty kick.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:01.410
Wh-What happened to him?!

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:05.370
I don't know. This is the first
time this has ever happened.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.580
Don't worry about it.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.370
Knock-on.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:42.910
What a waste!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:50.290
I'm glad my opponent looks so light.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.250
Hah?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.500
Stop it.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.370
Crouch.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.580
Bind.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:57.790
Set.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.370
This guy's shoulder is too low...

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.250
All right! Like I thought!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.080
Doushisha, Number 1. Collapsing.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.910
Huh?! No! He was obviously--

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:20.250
Fuuga!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.410
The atmosphere is really bad...

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.700
Try!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.040
Shit!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.870
God!

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:59.000
"Doushisha University"      "Sasa Institute University"
"Score"
"Total Score"

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:08.410
Are you all right? What happened?

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.080
Does it hurt somewhere?

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:12.120
Should I redo your taping?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.790
Go way.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.370
Huh?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:20.000
Don't come close to me right now.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.250
G-Got it...

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:26.200
Don't let yourself be provoked!

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.500
That's what they want!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.750
I-I'm sorry...

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:33.830
Don't rush! Keep calm!
Our skills are better than theirs.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.950
If we follow through
like usual, we will win.

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.000
Yes!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.000
Taisei.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.410
Yes.

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:41.410
Come with me.

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:44.330
Huh? Um, but right now...

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.580
Just come!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.040
Y-Yes...

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.910
M-Mako-<i>san</i>...

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.620
Why didn't you give Ueoka the ball?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.950
I-I wasn't really...

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:01.750
You hesitated on the pass!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.580
They got a try because of that play!

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.620
Taisei!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:12.450
He suddenly came back after
quitting the team all on his own!

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.950
He stole your position, Mako-<i>san</i>!

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:17.080
Doesn't that frustrate you?!

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:23.910
It does. Actually, it's pissing me off.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:27.080
I'm pissed off at myself for
being pitied by my junior.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:32.540
Are you looking down on me?

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:37.870
You think I'm the kind of person who'd be happy
that a junior messed up a play for me?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.040
No! I just...

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:43.750
Am I the type of person who can't
return to the starting line-up

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:46.830
unless you do something that cowardly?

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.830
That's what you're doing right now.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.580
I'm sorry.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:57.500
I'm the one who is sorry.

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.870
It's not your fault, Mako-<i>san</i>!

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:05.620
I'm sorry for making you do something like this.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.000
Please stop!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.450
I'm really sorry.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:13.370
But, stop doing stupid things like this!

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.870
For the future juniors that'll join us...

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.830
...please protect the honor of
Nagasakigaoka high school!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.370
Please...

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:38.040
Zaitsu-<i>senpai</i>. Please have
someone else be the kicker.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.950
What's wrong?

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.200
I can't score.

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:46.830
It'll probably be the same in the second half.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:49.700
No. It's your job.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.160
We will lose at this rate.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.950
Even if we change you out and win here,

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.040
we'll lose without you in the next match.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.750
We are aiming for nationals.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.830
I don't plan on using any quick fixes.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.870
Pull yourself together here.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.790
I understand.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.370
Yasunari.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:19.580
Yes?

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.000
Well...

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.540
"Doushisha University"      "Sasa Institute University"
"Score"
"Total Score"

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:50.330
The other number 15 is slow to the kick.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:53.500
On top of that, he spends a lot
of time just looking at the ball.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.200
His field of vision is small.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.950
I think it'll be easy to charge him.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:01.580
Give it a try. It should be easy
with those legs of yours.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.040
All right!

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:12.620
Shingyouji.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.160
You don't have to score.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:17.250
Do it the same way you do it when you practice.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.870
If you miss, we'll get the ball back.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:26.250
Don't think about winning or losing.
Just focus on the goal post. Got it?

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.290
Yes.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.660
Oh, thank goodness.

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.040
Good job.

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:56.160
Yes.

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:58.370
"Doushisha University"      "Sasa Institute University"
"Score"
"Total Score"

00:18:58.660 --> 00:18:59.410
Listen up.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.000
Move with caution.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.120
In terms of power, there's no way we would lose.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.250
Make sure not to cause any fouls.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:08.410
We're going to ride this wave!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.870
Yes!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.290
Crouch.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.200
Bind.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.410
Set.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.450
What was that sound?

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.700
What?

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.330
Takumi?

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.330
Takumi!

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.870
"Yamamoto Central Hospital"

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:49.540
Natsusa!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:52.250
How is Takumi?

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:58.370
As we thought, he tore his Achilles heel...

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.500
He cannot play the rest of this season.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.950
Where is he?

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:06.330
In room number three.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:11.870
Natsusa...

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.700
Why?

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:16.200
It's enough that I got injured...

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.580
Why even Taku-<i>senpai</i>...?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.200
Good match guys!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.660
Good match.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:34.120
Was Hidaka-<i>kun </i>all right?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.870
It was when we hit each other,
after all. I feel bad.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.410
He was so small I didn't see him.

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:41.330
You bastard!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:42.750
I'm gonna murder you!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.580
Stop it!

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:46.790
There's no use saying anything now.

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.410
We'll just look pathetic.

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:54.080
We lost!

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:00.080
Yuu.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:01.660
Yes?

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.120
Sorry.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.580
About what?

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.660
